# React Doctor (required after UI work)

After finishing React/Next UI changes (feature, bugfix, refactor):

```bash
npm run doctor
# = npx react-doctor@latest --verbose --scope changed
```

- If the score drops or errors appear → fix, then re-run.
- Full-repo audit when asked or before a large release: `npm run doctor:full`.
- Skill (Claude / Cursor via `.agents` / Codex): `react-doctor` — do **not** reinstall with `npx react-doctor install --yes` (installs every agent). Keep only `.agents`, `.claude`, `.codex` skill copies in this repo.
